a3=A.ad(1,"Even fellow Bozos find it hard to tell the Dead Ringers apart and that\u2019s despite their different hair colors. As far as we know, they were born and bred in Night City and, despite their doll-like appearance and playful demeanor, they are deadly little terrors.\n\nAfter much observation, I\u2019ve noticed some differences between the two. For example, the blue-haired one is the louder of the twins. She\u2019s always telling jokes, making it hard to ignore her. She obviously loves the attention. In a fight, she\u2019ll juggle poison grenades or vials, run around the field, and even set fire to things. All while giggling and cracking wise.\n\nThe blue-haired Dead Ringer is the distraction. She\u2019s loud and flashy on purpose. Like many Bozos, she loves grenades, and usually laces her Scratchers with poison. \n\nWhile her sister will try to pick your pocket, this one prefers looting your corpse when you\u2019re twitching on the ground.\n\nWhen it comes to Bozo stans (and yes, there are entire Garden Patches dedicated to clown fandom) the Dead Ringers rank only behind Jester and Tom Fool in popularity.",B.cE,B.az,0,B.jY,k9,!1,n,"Dead Ringer (The Blue One)",B.asU,"","danger_gal_dossier/Bozo_DeadRingers_Paintover_Blue.png",3,A.a([],k),A.a([],g),p,A.a([A.a([new A.c(k9,B.a7,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.y,k9,6),new A.c(k9,B.a3,k9,6),new A.c(k9,B.a9,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.P,k9,6),new A.c(k9,B.F,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.C,k9,6),new A.c(k9,B.D,k9,5),new A.c(k9,B.af,k9,3)],j)],i),a3,k9)
