a7=A.ad(1,"Jade Sky was once one of the greatest acrobatic fire-spinners Night City has ever seen. I was a huge fan back in the day. Her star was rising until, during a particularly dangerous performance involving helium balloons, a fire broke out in the theater. The helium ignited, causing massive damage to the building, the audience, and Jade. In total, ninety-four died. Jade survived but lost both legs in the explosion. Easily replaced, I know, but she vanished from the scene as rumors spread about her unsafe helium storage practices.\n\nYears later, Jade resurfaced as a member of the Bozos, now sporting cybertech legs (installed by Big Top himself, I hear) and the Bozos\u2019 classic clown style. Calling herself Jester, her favorite prank involves putting on a show as a street performer, luring in a crowd, then watching as her circus-mates rush in from the shadows and do their worst.\n\nJester lives for spectacle. When there\u2019s an audience, Jester takes more risks. Bounding around the battlefield, brawling with her legs, slashing flesh with her feet, and taking a shot. All before jumping back to a safe distance, laughing all the while.\n\nI hear, even after all this time Jester still has a fear of helium fire. A helium fire with its orange-pink flame might well throw her off her game.",B.ly,B.az,0,B.jY,"Bouncing Bozo Beauty",!1,n,"Jester",B.atP,"","danger_gal_dossier/Bozo_Jester_Paintover_v3.png",4,A.a([new A.kt(4,B.cZ)],k),A.a([],g),p,A.a([A.a([new A.c(k9,B.a7,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.y,k9,8),new A.c(k9,B.a3,k9,7),new A.c(k9,B.a9,k9,3),new A.c(k9,B.P,k9,6),new A.c(k9,B.F,k9,5),new A.c(k9,B.C,k9,8),new A.c(k9,B.D,k9,6),new A.c(k9,B.af,k9,3)],j)],i),a7,k9)
