b8=A.ad(1,"Growing up with her fathers, two Zhirafa engineers, Pat had exposure to construction machines from a young age and developed a fascination with the sounds and rhythms they produced. As a child, she experimented with creating her own music using circuit boards and electronic components salvaged from drones and other technology her fathers dragged home from work.\n\nAs she grew up, Pat noticed her music skills made her popular. Craving greater acclaim, she learned to play guitar and implanted an AudioVox, hoping to grow a fanbase and attract notice as a Rockerboy. Cultivating a persona as a rebel musician, Pat loves recording speeches for her Garden Patch followers about how her objective in life is giving power back to the people. So far, no one has bothered to ask her exactly what she\u2019s actually doing to restore that power.\n\nAlthough Jos\xe9 writes the songs and Andr\xe9 sets the beat, it is Pat\u2019s husky stylings and sharp, intense delivery to which, first and foremost, fans gravitate. Pat\u2019s also gaining attention for the judo throws she uses when fans try to give her unwanted extra attention. \n\nHarsher critics in Night City believe she\u2019s just a talentless, pretty face who draws fans more for her popularity and looks than for her musical ability. Pat\u2019s fans argue male Rockerboys never face such criticism.",B.cE,B.az,0,B.qJ,"Power to the People?",!1,p,"Pat Rezin",B.at9,"","danger_gal_dossier/Edgerunners_PowermetalRockerboy_Paintover_v2.png",5,A.a([new A.kt(4,B.cZ)],k),A.a([],g),n,A.a([A.a([new A.c(k9,B.a7,k9,5),new A.c(k9,B.y,k9,5),new A.c(k9,B.a3,k9,6),new A.c(k9,B.a9,k9,6),new A.c(k9,B.P,k9,6),new A.c(k9,B.F,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.C,k9,3),new A.c(k9,B.D,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.af,k9,5)],j)],i),b8,k9)
