d7=A.ad(1,"Birth name unknown. Blades has been on The Street since she was a very young child, and she\u2019s survived on sheer grit, determination, and a lot of luck. She\u2019s made many connections during her time on the streets, and she knows the scavenging sites of the Old Combat Zone inside and out. Her experience of lacking safety and security is likely why she wants it so badly in her life, and she admired Danger Gal even before Tigress of Puma Squad first contacted her.\n\nBlades lost her eye and her legs fighting off a group of scavengers who were trying to eliminate the competition, and the story\u2019s gotten around \u2013 she\u2019s got a reputation for fighting like a wildcat among her contacts. As a gesture of good will in the recruitment efforts, Danger Gal funded the replacement of Blades\u2019 medical-grade cyberlegs with the upgradeable ones and skate feet she has now. \n\nBlades isn\u2019t quite sure what to do with Tetra\u2019s hero-worship, but she\u2019s invested in the kids in the gang. Tigress has encouraged Blades to use her influence to convince the other members of Generation Red to work with Danger Gal. \n\nI\u2019m not sure she\u2019ll manage to do anything other than cause a schism, but hey \u2013 I\u2019m just the analyst here, right?",B.cE,B.az,0,B.n7,"On the Edge of Adulthood",!1,n,"Blades",B.asP,"","danger_gal_dossier/GenRed_Blades_Paintover_v2.png",1,A.a([new A.kS(2,B.bV)],k),A.a([],g),p,A.a([A.a([new A.c(k9,B.a7,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.y,k9,7),new A.c(k9,B.a3,k9,6),new A.c(k9,B.a9,k9,3),new A.c(k9,B.P,k9,5),new A.c(k9,B.F,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.C,k9,7),new A.c(k9,B.D,k9,3),new A.c(k9,B.af,k9,5)],j)],i),d7,k9)
