f1=A.ad(1,"The literal \u201cmailed fist\u201d of Maelstrom is a big, scarred, blunt instrument of a guy named Quake. While he\u2019s not stupid, he knows his limits. Quake trusts Warlock implicitly and follows his lead. In return, Warlock makes sure Quake gets to lead the gang\u2019s rabble in lots of riots and throwdowns, especially against the Inquisitors. \n\nSome gangers gear up to fight fellow chromers. Quake specializes in \u201cchewing up meat,\u201d as he calls it. Everything about him \u2014 the massive, customized hammer and built-in revolver, his deliberately chunky linear frame, his glossy black leathers, and the red underlighting built into all of them \u2014 is there to draw in anti-cyberware extremists. \n\nEveryone in Maelstrom\u2019s lost people to Inquisitor ambushes. Quake\u2019s their avenger. He doesn\u2019t just kill, he terrifies. The rest of the crew blocks a band of Inquisitors into a vacant lot or building while Quake singlehandedly tears them apart. \n\nI saw him pull a guy into a storm drain by his ankle. Through the grate. \n\nLow-level members are adopting Quake\u2019s style. Not just the leathers and red lights, either \u2013 but the messy killings, too. We could be seeing the start of outright war. ",B.hH,B.az,0,B.ib,"Lord of the Hammer",!1,n,"Quake",B.au0,"","danger_gal_dossier/Maelstrom_Hammerlord_Paintover_v2.png",5,A.a([new A.cE(6,B.aw)],k),A.a([],g),p,A.a([A.a([new A.c(k9,B.a7,k9,5),new A.c(k9,B.y,k9,8),new A.c(k9,B.a3,k9,8),new A.c(k9,B.a9,k9,3),new A.c(k9,B.P,k9,8),new A.c(k9,B.F,k9,7),new A.c(k9,B.C,k9,6),new A.c(k9,B.D,k9,12),new A.c(k9,B.af,k9,2)],j)],i),f1,k9)
