f8=A.ad(1,"Officer Majumdar is fresh out of the mold, having just graduated from the NCPD Training Program a month ago. As such, he\u2019s bright-eyed and chock full of clich\xe9 ideas about \u201cmaking a difference\u201d and \u201cserving the public.\u201d \n\nHe\u2019s been put on patrol in the University District to help him find his Street Legs, but he\u2019s already had some dust-ups with private security. Note that he\u2019s got a bit of a chip on his shoulder regarding \u201crent-a-cops\u201d, which might extend to Danger Gal operatives, especially those working in the private security sector.\n\nStill, he\u2019s displayed some good skills so far, being quick to back up his partners. There are two incidents of freezing up in his jacket, which might just be freshman jitters, but, if he gets three, I\u2019d worry about a pattern. At least he hasn\u2019t shot any bystanders yet. \n\nBut all his naivete can be put to use if you can convince him that cooperating with Danger Gal will further the public good. We might see if we can arrange to assign Officer Majumdar to Officer Navarro in order to cultivate his idealism. \n\nI think it\u2019s important to keep this kid out of trouble\u2026 at least until he\u2019s properly groomed. And any leverage we use should be all public-spirit carrot, no stick. ",B.aL,B.az,0,B.jp,"Officer Ranbir Majumdar",!1,p,"Cherub",B.asb,"","danger_gal_dossier/Lawmen_Rookie1_Paintover_v2.png",0,A.a([],k),A.a([],g),n,A.a([A.a([new A.c(k9,B.a7,k9,5),new A.c(k9,B.y,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.a3,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.a9,k9,2),new A.c(k9,B.P,k9,2),new A.c(k9,B.F,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.C,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.D,k9,5),new A.c(k9,B.af,k9,5)],j)],i),f8,k9)
