i2=A.ad(1,"They always say it\u2019s the quiet ones you should be wary of. Paladin is a man of few words, and should he speak them, they\u2019ll either make you laugh, or they will be the last words you ever hear. Growing up on The Street in Night City, he always knew he had what it took to climb up out of the Combat Zone and into a better life. Paladin signed up with Militech, doing a few tours protecting weapons runs, high value assets, and dropping down into many high-risk situations. \n\nHe soon gained a reputation for being business-minded and following a mission plan to the letter. No problem too big, no emotions in the way. At some point he realized that as a Solo, going full freelance would provide more opportunities and a bigger payday. And as a man with a lot of life experience, he now \u201cenjoys watching the youngsters mess up,\u201d as he has been known to put it.\n\nYou can recognize him from a mile away thanks to his signature beard (Maryanne Freeman at the Forlorn Hope describes it as a \u201cmajestic waterfall\u201d) but chances are he won\u2019t do more than grunt at you if you greet him.\n\nPaladin runs point for Team Monster on combat ops and if you\u2019re ever interrogated by the rest of the crew and they threaten to \u201cget the stick?\u201d That\u2019s him.",B.cD,B.az,0,B.qK,"Beast of a Battler",!1,p,"Paladin",B.atD,"","danger_gal_dossier/TeamMonster_Paladin_Paintover.png",4,A.a([new A.cE(5,B.aw)],k),A.a([],g),n,A.a([A.a([new A.c(k9,B.a7,k9,5),new A.c(k9,B.y,k9,7),new A.c(k9,B.a3,k9,7),new A.c(k9,B.a9,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.P,k9,4),new A.c(k9,B.F,k9,6),new A.c(k9,B.C,k9,5),new A.c(k9,B.D,k9,7),new A.c(k9,B.af,k9,3)],j)],i),i2,k9)
