B.D=new A.eD("Body","Your size, toughness, and ability to stay alive and conscious due to physical mass, structure, or other qualities. This STAT is important for determining how much damage you can take.","BODY",8,"Body")
B.af=new A.eD("Empathy","Your ability to relate to and care for others, and take others into consideration. Particularly important as it offsets the effects of cyberpsychosis, a dangerous mental illness common in the Dark Future.","EMP",9,"Empathy")
